{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46132","headline":"读吴越春秋 · 贯休","name":"读吴越春秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犹来吴越尽须慙，背德违盟又信谗。\n宰嚭一言终杀伍，大夫七事祗须三。\n功成献寿歌飘雪，谁爱扁舟水似蓝。\n今日雄图又何在，野花香径鸟喃喃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}